@startuml
title TASK-260712-9i5se7 - Windows main-window and tray shell

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
component "WindowsShell\nportable state + EN/RU copy" as Model
component "Win32 main window\nHome / Create / Join / Try /\nHistory / Settings" as Main
component "Win32 tray\nOpen / Create / Join / Try /\nRecord / DND / Quit" as Tray
component "Accelerator + dialog navigation\nCtrl shortcuts / Tab / Narrator labels" as Access
component "PerMonitorV2 layout\n96 / 120 / 144 / 192 DPI" as DPI
component "Existing runtime projection" as Runtime
component "Later capture + data integration" as Later
component "Manual real-app evidence\nEPIC-260714-th54l3" as Manual

User --> Main
User --> Tray
Main --> Model
Tray --> Model
Runtime --> Model : health, presence, route,\nnow playing, DND, volume
Access --> Main
DPI --> Main
Model ..> Later : recording, self-test, history seams
Main ..> Manual
Tray ..> Manual

note bottom of Model
Unpaired and degraded states stay honest.
Text tokens supplement every state color.
No capture/self-test success is simulated.
end note

@enduml
